<description>&lt;p&gt;Algerian troops have moved into Niger to protect energy assets as jihadist attacks increase, while Niger's NSCDC detention facility saw 14 children die among 33 detainees from overcrowding and asphyxiation. Russian-affiliated forces continue killing civilians in Mali, and Russia hosted an African leaders summit to deepen ties with the continent. Burkina Faso is advocating youth training at the Russia-Africa summit. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNbTFGZkdPQW9jLVZKcU03dE92NVI4d09jLWgwUjBJOWFGVndjS2JaNjlzWVdFcmZUSlRCY0dEcTI4YTFVeXdyLVZKd1JZLUZKNGNiUG1US1ZMZU9ySWY5bnkxNlFpZzMzbFpvc08wQURrYjRVeFVKMmRsdnY4QXVKdjFCcklVT2FkRmRscms4dGNRQ1JUQTdqeW9FcHhMazdIVDA0V25BWXItOFJQNVNXUDBsdGpsMDQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxPQnhKck5ZZE5iNHNUR1oyS3BsTkdQRGx3dHVUeXZzbnVuRjZ1T2ktQzVRSk9rbS1YZjByM3dnd3dwdlAtQmE0WWFpRjhpTVg1M01CWUVZWDhmeExLWjBJUmc4QzBLc3QyS2pZSEtEdzlaV05FUlI1cDlaWXVQRURmOW53ZzVUdnAtejdEWW9PUXViZEd2MWFoaUpDbURnQmdYdHNvQTdQZWpRbkRNS0I2TFdwYTdlN0ZfTHlqcUhSdmtTVzdsQlBuQ2lB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPMTBvNkQ5Q0xEUnlCcEFNVGRXUzFSbUF4ZGFveGJQYWtiVTRUVWtJOG0tbUhHWHpKcVJXSWRkdHdzMzZERExqRVByY0JYUHBQN1ByQlRNUkxZZWd4MlRQV3ZDU1lpX0ZfYXcxM0V1ay1mejJrTjZlLThITWhPRUVNUjR3amV2Q3dQUE5QaTFZOV9XTlFzQ2hrRkFMQWkweEgtS0M5cTc0Y29TTEU4cmNhTDE2RHBmME5F?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPVU5UZ2w5YVgxcmV4aUswWEhzbXN4T0E5MkNmMldSRVVsSzFocE01clctNUlzSlc0Z1FkLVp1aVNXTlgwejNILW1LT3JwbGNFTjlaanFSNHM0TGZ5V0Njc2FQMTd1SVhfNkMteDlub2MwTGFNdkZfQ1Y5YnpvaGxxa0o2VndDaFNHakg5M3VJdVJ2elkwQS1pSU05Z09DTDNKaEdvcjB5